    "created_at": "2018-03-22T16:38:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-22T16:38:41Z",
    "body": "The specification currently states\r\n\r\n> The [`WritableStream()`](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#ws-constructor) constructor accepts as its first argument a JavaScript object representing the [underlying sink](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#underlying-sink).\r\n\r\nWe can define a method at the JavaScript object passed to `WritableStream()` constructor\r\n\r\n```\r\nlet WSController = class {\r\n  constructor(/* data */) {\r\n    this.bytesSoFar = 0;\r\n  }\r\n  progress(controller) {\r\n    console.log(controller, this.bytesSoFar);\r\n  }\r\n  start(controller) {\r\n    console.log(controller);\r\n  }\r\n  write(data, controller) {\r\n    this.progress(controller, ++this.bytesSoFar);\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n..\r\n\r\nlet wscontroller = new WSController();\r\n\r\nlet writableStream = new WritableStream(wscontroller);\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
